cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FCCQuadrature.jl"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
abstract: >-
  FCCQuadrature.jl is a Julia package is a Julia implementation of variants
  of Filon-Clenshaw-Curtis (FCC) quadrature for computing finite
  one-dimensional complex and real Fourier integrals.
  Variants includes degree-subinterval hybrid adaptive integration
  with tone removal via automatic differentiation.
authors:
